SUMMARY:BBDC–TPVG Pro Forma Business Services Exposure Review
DESCRIPTION:Collaborative review of the proposed pro forma industry-exposure calculation using BBDC’s and TPVG’s latest 10-Q reports and September 30\, 2025 fair-value data. Confirm inclusion of only industry categories explicitly naming business services\, treatment of Muon as the sole non-services provider within TPVG’s “Business Products and Services” category\, the combined fair-value denominator\, and percentage rounding to two decimal places. The meeting is for methodology\, source\, and calculation review\; no analytical result is presupposed.
LOCATION:Virtual — BBDC/TPVG filing review
